<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Mending</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 14)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast mending &lt;item you carry&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster runs a hand along the item and chants 'Riforj', and it glows 
with a warm light: some of its wear is mended, up to a sixth of what it 
can take.
</p><p>It is a small spell for small damage. It only works on an item that is 
still in fair shape, with more than half its strength left; for worse 
damage, see repair and reconstruct. And every mending costs the item 
something: each time, the most wear it can ever take shrinks by an 
eighth, so an item mended again and again grows ever more fragile. 
Indestructible items need no mending.
</p><p>You must be standing, and carry the item. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
